		{
			"id": "BPManual_Help",
			"text": {
				"en-US": "Basic command List: \n/help {command name} - Output usage of a command\n/gamerule get {gamerule name} - Get the value of a game rule\n/gamerule set {gamerule name} {new value} - Set the value of a game rule to a new one\n/shift {dx} {dy} - Shift your contraption on grid\n/setpart {x} {y} {part type} {custom index} {grid rotation} {flip value} sets a new part at certain location\n/fill {x1} {y1} {x2} {y2} {part type} {custom index} {grid rotation} {flip value} fills a rectangular area with part\nAdditional arguments: \n#multiline - Execute commands on multiple lines",
				"zh-Hans": "基本命令列表：\n/help {命令名称} - 输出命令的用法\n/gamerule get {gamerule name} - 获取游戏规则的值\n/gamerule set {gamerule name} {new value} - 设置游戏规则的值\n/shift {dx} {dy} - 在网格上移动载具\n/setpart {横坐标} {纵坐标} {部件类型} {皮肤值} {网格旋转值} {翻转值} 在特定位置设置新零件\n/fill {横坐标1} {纵坐标1} {横坐标2} {纵坐标2} {部件类型} {皮肤值} {网格旋转值} {翻转值} 在矩形区域内设置新零件\n附加参数：\n#multiline - 在多行上执行命令"
			}
		},
